   "title": "Sa with position words",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "t": "Sa can be followed by a noun that names a **position**. Together they show the direction or location of a person or thing. Often **ng** + another noun follows, to say *inside of what*, *in front of what*, and so on."
