  {
   "title": "Periods of time",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "t": "Just like gáling sa, mulâ sa and búhat sa, sa can also show a **period of time**. But for time, only **mulâ** and **búhat** work (not gáling). A third word joins them: **hanggáng** (*until*)."
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "t": "These three are paired with **noón** (literally *then*), **sa**, **ngayón** (now), and with hours or dates."
    },
    {
     "type": "table",
     "head": [
      "Phrase",
      "Meaning"
     ],
     "rows": [
      [
       "[[mulâ noón hanggáng sa ngayón|other]]",
       "since then until now"
      ],
      [
       "[[mulâ sa|marker]] / [[búhat sa|marker]] + time, date or period",
       "from + time, date or period"
      ],
      [
       "[[hanggáng sa ngayón|other]]",
       "until now"
      ],
      [
       "[[hanggáng sa|marker]] + time, date or period",
       "until + time, date or period"
      ]
     ],
     "title": "Time combinations"
    },
